# ===========================================================
# ZAP Daemon - Environment Configuration
# ===========================================================
# The ZAP daemon uses CLI arguments (see docker-entrypoint.sh),
# not environment variables. This file exists for documentation.
#
# ZAP is configured with:
#   - Daemon mode on 0.0.0.0:8080
#   - API key disabled (internal network only)
#   - 120-second connection timeout
# ===========================================================

# No environment variables are required.
# All configuration is in docker-entrypoint.sh.
